# Big Data & NoSQL

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates the basics of Big Data processing and NoSQL database operations using MongoDB and PySpark.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Learn NoSQL database concepts.
- Perform CRUD operations in MongoDB.
- Process large datasets using PySpark.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- MongoDB
- PySpark
- Jupyter Notebook

